    - target: {fileID: 2116517601969916342, guid: 183e809bca3827e41a67b7345a91f0c2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Graphical and processing advancements to smartphones brought forth
        the age of mobile and casual gameplay through the late 2000s through the
        convenience of playing video games out of your pocket.


        Early forms
        of mobile gaming have previously existed in simple games on older devices,
        such as Pong and Snake.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
